DESCRIPTION:Another Planet Entertainment presents\nFondness\, Etc. Tour\nS
 hakey Graves\nTuesday\, October 20 | The Castro\n\nAcross his career\, Sha
 key Graves—a.k.a. the performance moniker of Austin\, Texas-born Alejand
 ro Rose-Garcia—has intentionally created thrilling musical adventures ta
 ilored to each fan: burning CDs and putting them in personalized decorated
  bags\; building intricate scavenger hunts that send fans in search of uni
 que tapes\; and Bandcamp-exclusive releases.\n\n“The fans and musicians 
 that really resonate with me—and the inexplicable ways that I find thing
 s that I like—are usually entirely through randomness and chaos and acci
 dent\,” Rose-Garcia says. “I’ve always been on this quest to make pe
 ople feel like my own music is a choose your own adventure.”\n\nIn 2024 
 Rose-Garcia celebrated the ten year anniversary of his And The War Came al
 bum with a special 10 Year Anniversary Edition release featuring never bef
 ore heard demos and b-sides from the recording process and inviting fans t
 o enter the long-since abandoned Music House.\n\nHis story continues to un
 fold\, but Shakey Graves Is Still A Gentleman From Texas.\n\nall ages\nAno
 ther Planet Entertainment presents: Fondness\, Etc. Tour\nListed time is d
 oors\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/20/shakey-graves-wild
 -pink-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
