SUMMARY:Kylie Cantrall
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261021T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261021T220000
DTSTAMP:20261022T120138Z
UID:dothebay-17696597@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:2
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:Goldenvoice Presents\nKylie Cantrall\n\nWednesday\, October 21
  | The Warfield\n\nIf tickets in the accessible section are unavailable\, 
 please reach out to the venue for accommodations. Please note\, orders in 
 violation of the published ticket limit are subject to cancellation withou
 t notice. Ticket prices may fluctuate\, at any time\, based on demand.\n\n
 Multihyphenate actress\, singer and songwriter Kylie Cantrall played the l
 ead title character ‘Red\,’ the daughter of the Queen of Hearts in Dis
 ney’s hit film “Descendants: The Rise of Red.” Following the massive
  success of the film\, Kylie performed in “Descendants/Zombies: Worlds C
 ollide Tour\,” a live concert experience which sold-out 40 arenas across
  North America. Kylie returned as ‘Red' to lead the sequel “Descendant
 s: Wicked Wonderland\,” which premiered on Disney+ in July 2026.\n\nLast
  year\, Kylie released her highly anticipated debut EP titled “B.O.Y.”
  through Artist Partner Group which included her singles “Boy for a Day\
 ,” “Goodie Bag\,” “Denim\,” and “See U Tonight.” In 2026\, K
 ylie kicks off her new partnership with Republic Records\, debuting her br
 and-new EP Valley Girl Problems out July 24th. Produced by Tricky Stewart 
 (Rihanna\, Tyla) and written alongside Tayla Parx\, the nine-track project
  marks a bold new chapter for Kylie continuing her evolution as both an ar
 tist and a cultural voice for a new generation.\n\nAll Ages\nGoldenvoice P
 resents\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/21/kylie-cantrall-
 tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7827039;-122.4103578
