BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Technocapitalist AI Blues Concert at Imbue HQ
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261022T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261022T210000
DTSTAMP:20261021T115902Z
UID:funcheap-1643292@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Live Music Event
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerJamie Simon\nJamie Simon\, PI 
 of the Feature Lab at Berkeley has been writing an album of folk songs abo
 ut AI. Like Technocapitalist AI-Powered Blues\, a Bob Dylan-inspired song 
 about four tech CEOs.\n“well\, one of the suits\, he’s kind of a dicka
 nd if his Face were a Book I’d shut it real quickhe’s a wannabe king\,
  a little Caesarbut instead of pizza sells social mediawell\, he came down
  from his Metaverse throneand saw that he was all aloneand he was feeling 
 left outand it was getting him downso he saddled up his LLaMa and he rode 
 into town…”\n\nJamie will be playing his songs for the first time live
 !In Jamie’s words:I’ve found that folk songs are somehow a really powe
 rful way to get through to people. Sharing these songs with people\, I’v
 e found that I can get across in one song what would have taken a half hou
 r to say worse. Of course\, there are already people writing folk songs ab
 out AI\, but honestly\, I think if your audience is Silicon Valley\, you n
 eed to know it from the inside. I’m an insider: I’ve been employed by 
 an AI startup for the past four years. I’ve seen what Silicon Valley get
 s right\, and I’ve seen what it gets wrong. It’s really good at buildi
 ng\, at doing\, at discipline\, at personal growth and management\; it’s
  full of folly when it comes to people and the complexities of society\, w
 hich it always reduces to cartoons. It’s hard to build something that ac
 tually benefits someone as a person when you only refer to them as a “us
 er” and only...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://luma.com/n6j7vvod?tk=TeQkkH\
 nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/technocapitalist-ai-blues-concert-imbue-
 hq-sf/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Screen
 shot-2026-10-19-at-2.06.05-PM.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261021T115902Z
LOCATION:Imbue HQ\, 292 Ivy St San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/technocapitalist-ai-blues-concert-imbue-hq-sf/
END:VEVENT
