DESCRIPTION:MONSTA X are a globally renowned K-pop powerhouse formed by St
 arship Entertainment in 2015\, consisting of members SHOWNU\, MINHYUK\, KI
 HYUN\, HYUNGWON\, JOOHONEY\, and I.M. Known for their commanding stage pre
 sence and genre-blending sound that fuses hip-hop\, EDM\, and pop\, the gr
 oup has built a reputation as one of K-pop’s strongest live acts\, with 
 members actively contributing to songwriting and production as true all-ro
 und artists. They have achieved significant international success\, becomi
 ng the second male K-pop group to chart on the U.S. Top 40 and the third t
 o enter the Billboard 200 Top 10 with their first English-language album A
 ll About Luv (2020)\, while its follow-up The Dreaming (2021) also debuted
  on the Billboard 200. Having performed at major festivals like iHeartRadi
 o Music Festival\, Jingle Ball\, and Life Is Beautiful\, and collaborated 
 with artists including French Montana\, Steve Aoki\, and Sebastián Yatra\
 , MONSTA X continue to expand their global reach. Marking a decade of grow
 th\, they further solidify their legacy with their third English-language 
 album Unfold\, a deeply introspective project centered on healing\, vulner
 ability\, and emotional evolution\, reinforcing their status as one of the
  most globally resonant and forward-thinking acts in K-pop.\n\nall ages\nA
 nother Planet Entertainment Presents: 2026 MONSTA X WORLD TOUR [THE X : NE
 XUS] IN SAN FRANCISCO\nListed time is doors\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.c
 om/events/2026/10/22/monsta-x-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
