SUMMARY:“Lower Polk Live!” Free Street Festival w/ Art\, DJs\, Live Mu
 sic
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261023T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261023T210000
DTSTAMP:20261024T111224Z
UID:funcheap-1636200@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:3
CATEGORIES:Live Music Event
DESCRIPTION:Lower Polk CBDLower Polk Live! returns to Polk Street for a fr
 ee neighborhood celebration of music\, art\, and community.\nExperience an
  evening of live entertainment\, local art\, creative experiences\, and mo
 re in the heart of Lower Polk. Featuring performances from Top Chefs\, JP 
 Breganza\, and more.\nExperience turntable culture with Skratchfight — s
 cratch\, spin\, get on the decks for the first time\, or jump in and jam. 
 Join Westside Steppaz for Soul line dancing and stepping! No experience ne
 eded grab your friends\, hit the dance floor\, and step with us! All Ages 
 Welcome-Pet Friendly.\n“Lower Polk Live!” Street Festival\nFriday\, Oc
 tober 23\, 2026 | 4-9p\nPolk Street (Btwn Bush & Sutter Streets)\, SF\nFRE
 E – RSVP Encouraged – All ages\nTHE TOP CHEFS\nBAY AREA FUSION BAND ·
  CREATORS OF STOOP SESSIONS\nThe Top Chefs are a powerhouse live band base
 d in San Francisco. Known for their dynamic performances that blend hip-ho
 p\, jazz\, R&B\, and soul\, the group transforms stages with a sound that 
 is both forward-thinking and rooted in tradition.\nThey have performed acr
 oss the USA\, UK\, Europe\, and South America. Their versatility allows th
 em to command festival stages\, jazz clubs\, corporate events\, family-fri
 endly gatherings\, and weddings alike\, offering tailored live experiences
  ranging from full-band productions to intimate acoustic sets.\nTheir line
