DESCRIPTION:KQED Live & KEXP Present\nHaunted Riot with Frightwig: An Alt 
 Punk Show\nFriday\, October 23 | The Chapel\n\nCo-presented by KEXP\n\nThe
  Chapel has always held stories\, but before it was a music venue\, it was
  a mortuary. This October\, lean into that history for a one-night-only pu
 nk show in San Francisco.\n\nThe night opens with a live storytelling set 
 from Bay Curious\, uncovering the eerie and unexpected history of The Chap
 el and setting a spooky tone for what’s to come. From there\, the lights
  drop and alt/punk acts AroMa and Frightwig take over\, moving from haunti
 ng atmosphere to full-volume chaos.\n\nThis is a Spooky-season show that
 ’s part ghost story\, part punk ritual\, all happening inside one of San
  Francisco’s most atmospheric rooms.\n\n$15-$25\nKQED Live & KEXP Presen
 t\nListed time is doors\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/23
 /haunted-riot-with-frightwig-an-alt-punk-show-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
