DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerBrahma Kumaris“There is a vo
 ice that doesn’t use words. Listen.” ~ Rumi\nIn an era of AI anxiety a
 nd endless career uncertainty\, your most future-proof skill is your human
  intuition. Disconnect from the digital noise and join us for a powerful\,
  gadget-free day of deep silence. Hit pause on the algorithms\, hit reset 
 on your mind\, and find clarity from the inside out.\n\nYour Practical Tak
 eaways:\n\nBuild Your Inner Compass: Learn the foundational steps to creat
 e a reliable intuition for deep\, authentic knowing.\nIntuition in Action:
  Discover how to apply your intuition to navigate uncertainties and make b
 etter daily decisions.\nCreative Experiments: Practice fun\, simple ways t
 o bypass overthinking and access deeper wisdom.\nElevate Your Vibe: Acquir
 e tools to consistently maintain a high-frequency energy state for greater
  resilience and attraction.\n\nSchedule includes: Guided Meditations\, Cre
 ative Exercises\, Mindful Eating\, Light Movement and Yogic Breathing\nThi
 s is a gadget-free event\, so you can fully immerse yourself in the experi
 ence. Don’t miss out on this opportunity to easily tap into the power of
  your heart!\nMusician: Kyoko Kimura\, certified healing harpist\nFacilita
 tors:\nHarsha Palli is a Meditation Teacher and practitioner of Rajayoga m
 editation since 2004\, holding a Master’s in Counseling Psychology. Hars
 ha blends a deep understanding of the mind with spiritual wisdom\, special
 izing in creating a calm and clear environment for others to experien...\n
 \nFree\n\nTickets: https://tockify.com/bksfevents/detail/584/1792859400000
 \nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/unmute-intuition-silent-reset-day-retre
 at/\nSource: Funcheap SF
