BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:When Manilatown Swung: The Manila Serenaders
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T160000
DTSTAMP:20261025T114202Z
UID:dothebay-17914041@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:2
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:WHEN MANILATOWN SWUNG: THE MANILA SERENADERS\n\nWhat did Manil
 atown sound like when Kearny Street was alive with music?\n\nStep into the
  sounds and stories of historic Manilatown for a special Club Mandalay: Mu
 sic\, Memory & Manilatown gathering featuring live jazz\, archival photogr
 aphs\, family memories\, and community Talk Story at the International Hot
 el Manilatown Center.\n\nAt the heart of the afternoon is Canuto Salaver\,
  a drummer with the Manila Serenaders whose life was deeply connected to h
 istoric Manilatown and the I-Hotel. Members of the Salaver Family join gue
 st interviewer Sabrina Oliveros to share family stories passed down about 
 Canuto-his life around Kearny Street\, his connection to the Bataan Cafe a
 nd Poolhall\, and his years making music with the Manila Serenaders.\n\nTh
 e musical lineage continues with Raymond Bambao\, bassist with today's Man
 ilatown Jazz Ensemble\, whose grandfather and grand-uncles also played wit
 h the Manila Serenaders.\n\nThroughout the afternoon\, the Manilatown Jazz
  Ensemble brings these histories back into sound with live musical interlu
 des inspired by the era\, while photographs and materials from the Manilat
 own Archives and family collections bring the world of historic Manilatown
  into view.\n\nAudience members will also be invited into the Talk Story-b
 ecause the memories carried by our families and communities are part of ho
 w history lives.\n\nAnd because history can be fun: Feeling festive? Come 
 dressed in your 1930s-40s finest! Period-inspired attire...\n\nFree\nManil
 atown Heritage Foundation\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/
 24/when-manilatown-swung-the-manila-serenaders-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n
 \nAlso listed on:\n- https://sf.funcheap.com/manilatown-swung-manila-seren
 aders-sf/
GEO:37.7961254;-122.4049416
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34760555/2e9d19c1-f4ef-4641-8d0a-3d3facc90124.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261025T114202Z
LOCATION:I-Hotel Manilatown Center in SF\, 868 Kearny St\, San Francisco\,
  CA\, 94108
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/24/when-manilatown-swung-the-manil
 a-serenaders-tickets
END:VEVENT
