DESCRIPTION:UNDISCOVERED SFTen Years. Three Events. One Anniversary Season
 . Made With Mahal.\nUNDISCOVERED SF returns to SoMa Pilipinas Filipino Cul
 tural Heritage District this fall to celebrate a decade of Filipino Americ
 an culture\, community\, and entrepreneurship across three unforgettable e
 vents that reflect the heart of UNDSCVRD.\nTen years ago\, UNDISCOVERED SF
  helped spark the city’s night market movement. For Season 10\, it retur
 ns to where Filipino cultural nightlife was born\, Ritch Street Alley in t
 he heart of SoMa Pilipinas for one landmark evening of food\, music\, art\
 , and community.\nIn partnership with Victory Hall (a cornerstone of the n
 eighborhood since 1908)\, the Golden Hour Night Market fills the fabled al
 ley with the best of Filipino American culture. Come hungry\, come ready t
 o move\, and come discover.\nJoin us for a two-venue celebration in the SO
 MA Pilipinas Cultural District\, where attendees can stroll the commercial
  corridor and visit local businesses and cultural hubs to shop\, eat\, and
  support artists\, creatives\, and small businesses.\nUndiscovered SF | Go
 lden Hour Night Market\nSaturday\, October 24\, 2026 | 4-10p\nVictory Hall
 \, 330 Ritch Street\, SoMa\, SF\nFREE | RSVP – All Ages (21+ afterparty 
 10p-1a)\n\nUNDISCOVERED SF\n\nUNDISCOVERED SF\n\nMUSIC\nLive DJ sets by Ho
 ochi the DJ\, DJ Vieux Carré\, Marky Method\, and DJ Boogie Brown\, plus 
 a live performance by Top Chefs Band of Live on the Stoop. Hosted by Emcee
  Fran Boogie.\nFOOD\nBerry Sweet · Cafe 86 · Fely’s Cuisine · Lady Vi
 ctory · Li...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://luma.com/raipa01b\nDetails: htt
 ps://sf.funcheap.com/undiscovered-sf-2026/\nSource: Funcheap SF
