CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:Goldenvoice Presents\nJai Wolf\n\nSaturday\, October 24 | ​T
 he Regency Ballroom\n\nAfter the success of indie-dance anthems like “In
 dian Summer” and “Starlight\,” blockbuster festival sets from Indio 
 to India\, and co-signs from the likes of Skrillex and ODESZA\, it’s cle
 ar from the opening notes of Jai Wolf’s long-awaited debut album The Cur
 e to Loneliness that he sees the expectations around his name as an opport
 unity to challenge convention.\n\nThe Cure to Loneliness finds Jai Wolf co
 mpleting his evolution from upstart bedroom remixer to future bass DJ to b
 uilder of lush musical worlds. While still very much dancefloor-focused\, 
 some tracks on the LP conjure the angular riffage of The Strokes and Phoen
 ix\, weave melodies through the sugary happysad of M83 and CHVRCHES\, or b
 uild up walls of sound like Explosions in the Sky—all while maintaining 
 the melodious polish and evocative groove to which fans have grown so clos
 e.\n\n“In my heart\, this album is me\,” says Jai Wolf. “From the so
 unds to the lyrics\, it’s everything that I’ve always wanted to do.”
  Taking a different approach to many of his contemporaries\, Jai Wolf larg
 ely eschewed singles over the course of two years to patiently craft The C
 ure to Loneliness. The result is a thoughtfully framed\, confidently expre
 ssed musical vision that will tug at heartstrings in 2019 and long beyond.
 \n\nThe arc of Jai Wolf’s live performances began with DJing during his 
 “Kindred Spirits” EP era (2016-2018) and has evolved into an all encom
 passing audio-v...\n\n18+\nGoldenvoice Presents\n\nDetails: https://dotheb
 ay.com/events/2026/10/24/jai-wolf-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
