DESCRIPTION:DaybreakerDaybreaker Boo-tiful Morning is coming to the newly 
 renovated Transamerica Pyramid Center Redwood Park.\nGather beneath the SF
  redwoods for a morning pulled straight out of a haunted storybook. Come a
 s you are. Or actually…this might be the one morning we ask you to come 
 as someone else entirely.\nBring the crew\, the kids\, the neighbors\, or 
 come solo. You’ll leave with new friends!\nCrisp autumn air. Towering tr
 ees. A dance floor unfolding while the city wakes up around us.\nDaybreake
 r Dance Party\nSunday\, October 25\, 2026 | 10a – 1p\nTransamerica Pyram
 id Center Redwood Park\, 600 Montgomery St\, SF\nTickets are $44.34 – $5
 4.63 (fees included) and include free coffee and alcohol-free drinks\, wor
 ld-class DJs\, live musicians\, and a dance floor made for actual dancing.
 \nThe Journey:\n\n10am-11am: Spooky Yoga\n11am-1pm: Haunt the Dance Floor\
 , Shake your Boo-ties\n1pm-1:15pm: Surprise Performance\n\nDaybreaker is a
  global sober daytime dance movement that has been around for 13+ years an
 d has impacted over 1 Million people.\n\nView this post on Instagram\n\nA 
 post shared by DAYBREAKER (@dybrkr)\n\n$44.34\n\nTickets: https://www.dayb
 reaker.com/event/san-francisco-10-25/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/da
 ybreaker-bootiful-morning-dance-party/\nSource: Funcheap SF
