CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:InterMusic SF proudly announces the 19th year of SF Music Day\
 , taking place Sunday\, October 25\, 2026\, at the San Francisco War Memor
 ial & Performing Arts Center. This year\, the festival returns to free adm
 ission\, showcasing 95 artists across 20 ensembles and more than six hours
  of continuous live music.\nArtists include the dynamic Latin music band B
 ululú\, the San Francisco Chamber Orchestra\, the legendary experimental 
 ensemble Rova Saxophone Quartet\, Sundra Manning Organ Quintet\, Cornelius
  Boots\, and The Sampaguitas. Hank Dutt\, former violist of Kronos Quartet
 \, and celebrated pianist Kate Campbell will debut their new collaboration
 \, the Dutt Campbell Duo. From bluegrass and Filipina folk to soul jazz\, 
 classical\, and experimental music\, the program reflects the region’s v
 ibrant and expansive musical landscape.\n\nFestival Highlights & Exclusive
  Performances:\nAnne Sajdera Quintet\nBululú\nCornelius Boots\nDutt Campb
 ell Duo\nEnsemble Humanité\nIan Carey and Wood Metal Plastic\nJazz in the
  Neighborhood’s JazzMobile\nJordan Glenn’s BEAK\nMarielle V Jakobsons\
 nNippon Kobo\nPawlik-Zwiebel Duo\nQuinteto Latino\nRaffi Garabedian Quarte
 t\nRova Saxophone Quartet\nSan Francisco Chamber Orchestra\nSixEight: Macl
 auchlan & Quale\nSundra Manning Organ Quintet\nThe Sampaguitas\nTrillian W
 elch\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fww
 w.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Fsf-music-day-2026-tickets-1996763292760\nDetails: h
 ttps://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/25/sf-music-day-tickets\nSource: DoTheB
 ay\n\nAlso listed on:\n- https://sf.funcheap.com/sf-music-day-2026-20-free
 -live-concerts-san-francisco-war-memorial/
GEO:37.7795732;-122.42101
