BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Joy Oladokun
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T200000
DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17666275@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:Another Planet Entertainment presents\nThe Heavy Things Tour\n
 Joy Oladokun\nSunday\, October 25 | The Castro\n\nJoy Oladokun is one of t
 oday’s most compelling genre-defying voices. A queer Black musician and 
 daughter of Nigerian immigrants\, Oladokun has become a vital cultural voi
 ce\, writing songs that explore identity\, faith\, mental health\, and soc
 ial justice with honesty and restraint. Those themes remain at the heart o
 f Hope Is A Heavy Thing\, Oladokun’s new 12-track album\, due September 
 25. Produced by Oladokun with additional contributions from Nigerian produ
 cer Spellz and a feature from Nigerian artist Adekunle Gold\, the album ma
 rks a bold new creative chapter\, broadening her sound while continuing to
  explore questions of identity\, resilience\, and belonging with the emoti
 onal depth that has become her signature. The project further reflects Ola
 dokun’s ability to draw from diverse influences while creating music tha
 t transcends genre and geography.\n\nSince her 2020 breakthrough\, Oladoku
 n has released three critically acclaimed albums\, was nominated for Ameri
 cana Artist of the Year\, and saw her protest anthem “i see america” n
 amed a finalist for the Recording Academy’s Special Merit Award for Best
  Song for Social Change. With collaborations spanning artists like Chris S
 tapleton\, Brandi Carlile\, Noah Kahan\, and Maxo Kream\, she is entering 
 her next chapter by bringing an even broader\, bolder sound to the table\,
  continuing to prove herself as an artist who not only bends genre but b..
 .\n\nall ages\nAnother Planet Entertainment presents: The Heavy Things Tou
 r\nListed time is doors\n\nTickets: https://ticketmaster.evyy.net/c/253185
 /264167/4272?SharedId=DoStuff&u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ticketmaster.com%2Fjoy-o
 ladokun-the-heavy-things-tour-san-francisco-california-10-25-2026%2Fevent%
 2F1C0064F7E974D20F%3Fcamefrom%3DCFC_ANOTHERPLANET_web%26brand%3Danotherpla
 net\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/25/joy-oladokun-tickets\
 nSource: DoTheBay
