BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sound Baths at Grace Cathedral
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261026T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261026T203000
DTSTAMP:20261020T194441Z
UID:funcheap-1642899@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Live Music Event
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerOver Power ProductionA Sound B
 ath Like Nowhere Else in San Francisco\nEnter the soaring architecture of 
 Grace Cathedral\, where light pours through stained glass and sound rises 
 skyward\, resonating between the Gothic columns.\n\nOur immersive Sound Ba
 th invites you into a transcendent sonic world crafted by Fractals of Soun
 d — a collective of celebrated Bay Area musicians\, Egemen Sanli\, Phoen
 ix Song\, and Sam Jackson.\nThis is more than a meditation. It is a full-b
 ody\, vibrational experience — a place to exhale\, reset\, and let sound
  carry you inward -discover spacious quiet. Settle in with your favorite m
 ats\, blankets\, and headrests\, cocooned with candlelight and a celestial
  wash of luminous light\, and rest on our sacred stone.\nLet waves of crys
 tal bowls\, frame drums\, flute\, overtone singing\, and devotional voice 
 move through you\, dissolving tension and awakening a grounded sense of pe
 ace and presence. In this sanctuary where generations have come to reflect
 \, renew\, and reconnect\, you’re invited to simply be — held by sound
 \, light\, and community.\nCome curious. Leave transformed.\nReserve your 
 space in one of San Francisco’s most extraordinary experiences.\nAbout F
 ractals of Sound\nEgemen Sanli is a modern dervish\, carrying the flag of 
 his Turkish roots as a musician. He plays the sitar alongside other ethnic
  instruments (shamisen\, saz\, hang and handpan drums\, banjo\, flutes). H
 e utilizes beats\, loops\, and tanpura machines to compliment his joyful i
 mprovi...\n\n$33.00\n\nTickets: https://gracecathedral.org/series/sound-ba
 ths-at-grace-cathedral/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/sound-baths-grac
 e-cathedral/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/202303
 27_Sound-Bath.-Web.-Cr.-Over-Power-Production-50.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261020T194441Z
LOCATION:Grace Cathedral\, 1100 California Street. San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/sound-baths-grace-cathedral/
END:VEVENT
