BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Death By Aria: Haunted Halloween Concert w/ Aerial Spectacle (Grac
 e Cathedral)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261028T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261028T220000
DTSTAMP:20261020T194441Z
UID:funcheap-1642888@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Live Music Event
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerTaste of TalentThis spooky sea
 son\, we are thrilled to invite you to DEATH BY ARIA\, San Francisco’s l
 egendary Halloween concert\, taking over Grace Cathedral for the first tim
 e!\n\nPresented by Taste of Talent\, Red Curtain Addict\, and Grace Cathed
 ral\, our Halloween tradition returns with extraordinary voices\, Aerial s
 pectacle\, virtuoso instruments\, and haunting projections\, inspired by t
 he question: If you had one last thing to sing or perform\, what would it 
 be?\n\nEnter the haunted cathedral and experience the fatal encounter betw
 een Carmen and Don José\, the murderous world of Lady Macbeth\, Phantom o
 f the Opera\, a Moulin Rouge cabaret\, and Piazzolla’s Libertango and La
  Muerte del Ángel. For an apocalyptic finale\, Interstellar meets the med
 ieval Dies Irae\, bringing together the thunder of the organ\, live ensemb
 le\, and an aerial spectacle overhead! Halloween-inspired cocktails\, wine
 \, and bites are included.\nOur superstar cast features soprano Charlotte 
 Kelso\, tenors Thomas Kinch and Christopher Oglesby\, oboist and vocalist 
 Jesse Rex Barrett\, saxophonist Valentin Kovalev\, aerialist and circus st
 ar Dwoira Galilea Scheffer\, projectionist Mark Johns\, and yours truly at
  the piano and as Master of Ceremonies – presiding as Gandalf the White!
 \n\nCast Team\nRonny Michael Greenberg\, Music Director\nJesse Rex Barrett
 \, Oboist & Vocalist\nValentin Kovalev\, Saxophonist\nEric Silberger\, Vio
 lin\nDwoira Galilea Scheffer\, Aerialist & Circus Star\nThomas Kinch\, Ten
 or\nCharlotte...\n\n$75.00\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/death-
 by-aria-tickets-2001984221699?aff=oddtdtcreator\nDetails: https://sf.funch
 eap.com/death-aria-haunted-halloween-concert-aerial-spectacle-grace-cathed
 ral/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Horizo
 ntal-1-compress.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261020T194441Z
LOCATION:Grace Cathedral\, 1100 California Street. San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/death-aria-haunted-halloween-concert-aerial-sp
 ectacle-grace-cathedral/
END:VEVENT
