DESCRIPTION:2026 Downtown San Francisco PartnershipKick off Halloween week
 end with San Francisco’s ultimate Halloween block party! Join us for a h
 auntingly good time with themed cocktails\, live music\, spooky activities
 \, and costumes galore on Front Street in downtown San Francisco. Nightmar
 e on Front is a larger iteration of the area’s block party events and wi
 ll take place in the Front Street Entertainment Zone (located between Cali
 fornia and Sacramento Streets)\, home to iconic downtown bars Schroeder’
 s\, Harrington’s Bar & Grill\, and the Royal Exchange.\nCome dressed in 
 your best Halloween costume and get ready to dance all night to some of SF
 ’s best live DJs. Grab a cocktail\, hit the dance floor\, enjoy great fo
 od and take over Front Street for one unforgettable night. DJ lineup comin
 g soon!\nGOOD TO KNOW\n\n📍 245 Front Street between Sacramento Street a
 nd California Street.\n🚆 Just a short 4-minute walk from the Embarcader
 o BART/MUNI Station\n🧑‍🧑‍🧒‍🧒 All ages event.\nDate and T
 ime\n\nFriday\, Oct 30\, 2026 2pm – 10pm\n\nLocation\n\nFront Street Ent
 ertainment Zone\n240 Front St\n\nPlease note: Attendees interested in cons
 uming alcohol (21+) must present a valid ID upon entry. Bikes\, strollers\
 , and four-legged fur babies welcome! This is a smoke-free event per SF He
 alth Code\, Article 19L.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://luma.com/frontstreet\
 nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/nightmare-front-street-free-halloween-bl
 ock-party-downtown-sf/\nSource: Funcheap SF
