DESCRIPTION:2026 SF Symphony: Elim Chan Conducts Adams Mendelssohn + Brahm
 s (Oct. 29-31)\nSF Symphony\nElim Chan conducts a quartet of works that de
 lve into the great unknown: Choral works by Brahms and Arvo Pärt lay a me
 ditative foundation\, while Renaud Capuçon regales us with the lustrous m
 elodies and glittering pyrotechnics of Mendelssohn’s Violin Concerto. Jo
 hn Adams’s Doctor Atomic Symphony cloaks Nuclear Age anxiety in dark orc
 hestral splendor.\nElim Chan Conducts Adams and Mendelssohn\nThursday – 
 Saturday\, October 29-31 2026 | 7:30p\nDavies Symphony Hall\, 201 Van Ness
  Ave.\, SF\nTickets start at $45\, with orchestra seats from just $59. Sec
 ure your seats!\nConcert Extras\n\nAn Inside Music Talk with Music Directo
 r Designate Elim Chan\, in conversation with Benjamin Pesetsky\, will be p
 resented on stage one hour before each concert. Free to all ticketholders.
 \n\nArtists\n\nElim Chan – Conductor\nRenaud Capuçon – Violin\nSan Fr
 ancisco Symphony Chorus – Jenny Wong\, Chorus Director\nSan Francisco Sy
 mphony\n\nProgram\n\nJohannes Brahms – Nänie\nFelix Mendelssohn – Vio
 lin Concerto\nArvo Pärt\nMagnificat\nFirst San Francisco Symphony Perform
 ances\nJohn Adams\nDoctor Atomic Symphony\nFirst San Francisco Symphony Pe
 rformances\n\nView this post on Instagram\n\nA post shared by San Francisc
 o Symphony (@sfsymphony)\n\nUpcoming 2026 SF Symphony: Elim Chan Conducts 
 Adams Mendelssohn + Brahms (Oct. 29-31) Events\nThu 10/29 2026 SF Symphony
 : Elim Chan Conducts Adams Mendelssohn + Brahms (Oct. 29-31)Fri 10/30 2026
  SF Symphony: Elim Ch...\n\n$45.00\n\nTickets: https://www.sfsymphony.org/
 Buy-Tickets/2026-27/Doctor-Atomic-and-Mendelssohn?utm_source=funcheap&amp\
 ;utm_medium=mobile_notification&amp\;utm_campaign=chan_adams\nDetails: htt
 ps://sf.funcheap.com/2026-sf-symphony-elim-chan-conducts-adams-mendelssohn
 -brahms-oct-29-31/\nSource: Funcheap SF
