SUMMARY:SET Halloween w/ Lost Miracle
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T230000
DTSTAMP:20261010T172246Z
UID:dothebay-17842386@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:SET Underground\, Konnected & Safra Present\nSET Halloween wit
 h Lost Miracle\nSébastien Léger & Roy Rosenfeld\n\nwith special guest Sa
 tori\n\nFriday\, October 30 | ​Public Works\n\nLost Miracle plays a 3-ho
 ur set for Halloween in San Francisco\, with special guest Satori. Public 
 Works\, Friday\, October 30.\n\n*SET Underground San Francisco*\n\nHallowe
 en usually means costumes and chaos\, not music worth remembering.\n\nFor 
 us is different. SET Underground brings Lost Miracle\, the collaborative p
 roject from Sébastien Léger and Roy Rosenfeld\, to Public Works for a 3-
 hour set on the venue's Funktion-One rig. Special guest Satori joins for t
