  the Rooftop at Hotel VIA.\n\nInspired by the glamour\, freedom\, and deca
 dence of disco’s golden era\, GLITTERATI brings together soulful house\,
  disco-infused rhythms\, immersive visuals\, curated art\, and a vibrant c
 reative community for an unforgettable evening above the city.\n\nSet agai
 nst the San Francisco skyline\, expect captivating music\, atmospheric lig
 hting\, elevated bites and cocktails\, and an intimate setting designed fo
 r dancing\, connection\, and self-expression.\n\nThe perfect opening chapt
 er to your Halloween night\, GLITTERATI invites you to dress up\, dance\, 
 and celebrate in style before the night takes you wherever comes next.\n\n
 Disco glamour is encouraged. Think shimmering fabrics\, metallics\, bold s
 ilhouettes\, vintage elegance\, and unapologetic individuality.\n\nCome fo
 r the music. Dress for the moment. Stay for the experience.\n\n21+\nThe Un
