DESCRIPTION:Thursday\, November 5th\, 9pm - 2am\n\nLoft / 21+ / Limited Ca
 pacity\n\nWant free entry? Check out the PW Union where members get event 
 access\, drinks\, skip the line\, and more starting at just $12/month or $
 10 with an annual plan: www.publicsf.com/membership\n\nLocal 500 and Publi
 c Works Present:\n\nFunction 500\n\nFor our eighth installment of our mont
 hly residency\, we will be local crew and event series organizer\, FLUXION
 S (@fluxions.exe). Representing FLUXIONS are co-founders Vertigo (@v.ertii
 g0) & bad juuju (@bad.juuju).\n\nFLUXIONS is bad juuju and Vertigo's event
  series that curates sweaty\, bassy and foggy DIY focused events in San Fr
 ancisco\, CA. Launching in 2024\, their events and HydeFM residency push s
 oundscapes that mutate in real-time\, weaving between hypnotic atmospheres
 \, pulsating beats\, and heavily percussive bass lines.\n\nIn true Local50
 0 (@local500sf) fashion\, we’re continuing to bring love back to Thursda
 y nights in San Francisco. Expect techno\, percussive bass lines\, groove\
 , and a tighter underground feel as we showcase local crews and producers.
 \n\nLocal500 support: Panderer(@panderer.dj) and AGROPOL(@agropol_)\n\nSho
 w up. Support local talent. Be apart of something...\n\nNovember 5th\n\n$5
  online - $10 at door\n\n9pm-2am\n\nbad juuju: Seamlessly weaving between 
 swirling psychedelic worlds\, percussive intensity\, and deep bass frequen
 cies\, bad juuju moves crowds with her eclectic approach rooted in club se
 nsibilities. As a member of rising San Francisco-based DJ collective Vitam
 in1000...\n\n$5-$10\, 21+\n\nTickets: https://tixr.com/af/dostuff/211559\n
 Details: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/5/local-500-public-works-pres
 ent-function-500-w-fluxions-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
