BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SYML
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261106T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261106T210000
DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17262064@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:Another Planet Entertainment presents\nSolo in North America T
 our\nSYML\nFriday\, November 6 | The Castro\n\nSYML is the solo venture of
  Seattle artist Brian Fennell. Welsh for “simple”— he makes music th
 at taps into the instincts that drive us to places of sanctuary\, whether 
 that be a place or a person.\n\nFennell’s latest offering\, Nobody Lives
  Here\, marks his clearest\, crispest writing. Written\, recorded\, and pr
 oduced by him and his longtime collaborator Brian Eichelberger\, it is fue
 led by the keen understanding that life is a contradiction\, a fleeting mo
 ment. But as we accept the presence of loss\, we can still welcome others 
 into our space with melody\, lyrics\, a slide guitar\, or a cello’s hum.
  His sense of humanity is his musical compass. As an artist\, Fennell take
 s license to both gut and be gutted. “If the dark inspires the good\, th
 at’s a good thing to be honest about\,” he says.\n\nHe released his se
 lf-titled debut album in 2019\, which includes the multiplatinum song “W
 here’s My Love” and the Gold Record fan favorite “Girl.” His 2023 
 sophomore album\, The Day My Father Died\, described by NPR as “euphoric
 \,” was recorded at Studio X with renowned producer Phil Ek and features
  collaborations with Elbow’s Guy Garvey\, Lucius\, Sara Watkins of Nicke
 l Creek\, and Charlotte Lawrence. His music has become the soundtrack to c
 ountless films and TV shows and was used by Lana Del Rey on the song “Pa
 ris\, TX\,” from her Grammy-nominated 2023 album.\n\nWith over four bill
 ion streams\, the multi-platinu...\n\nall ages\nAnother Planet Entertainme
 nt presents: Solo in North America Tour\nListed time is doors\n\nTickets: 
 https://ticketmaster.evyy.net/c/253185/264167/4272?SharedId=DoStuff&u=http
 s%3A%2F%2Fwww.ticketmaster.com%2Fsyml-san-francisco-california-11-06-2026%
 2Fevent%2F1C00648E9B6C9370%3Fcamefrom%3DCFC_ANOTHERPLANET_web%26brand%3Dan
 otherplanet\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/6/syml-tickets\n
 Source: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7619917;-122.4347365
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/31675671/32ad2c6c-4fd5-4f8e-8ca1-6154a196b947.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T003107Z
LOCATION:The Castro\, 429 Castro St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94114
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/6/syml-tickets
END:VEVENT
