BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Lucy Bedroque
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261106T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261106T210000
DTSTAMP:20261008T185326Z
UID:dothebay-17752476@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:Goldenvoice Presents\n003 Tour\nLucy Bedroque\nFriday\, Novemb
 er 6 | ​The Regency Ballroom\n\nLos Angeles based nineteen year old Jere
 miah Mark (they/he) released their first full-length endeavor under the mo
 niker Lucy Bedroque\, their deadAir Records debut. With no prior singles\,
  the breakneck seventeen track shotgun blast of Digicore and Hardcore Hip 
 Hop\, titled “Unmusique” has established them as a bastion of these un
 derground sounds. The release date coincided with their first show on the 
 Jane Remover and Dazegxd tour “TURN UP OR DIE”\, along with a full wes
 t coast run. Leading up to this moment\, Lucy Bedroque gained a cult follo
 wing in the shadowy sectors of the online underground\, with a break-out d
 ebut LP “Sisterhood” as Lostrushi. This is the name that raised them t
 o notoriety alongside peers 9lives\, prettifun\, and egobreak. The new mat
 erial continues further down the same path\, combining cutthroat rage\, wi
 th the eclecticism and sensitivities of Stereolab\, Radiohead\, and Defton
 es. While forging their distinct multi-media surrealism\, Mark also found 
 a penchant for customized linguistics and contorting the English language.
  Most notably\, the title “Glutmother” (the name fans chose for a hype
 r-active Subreddit) graces the cover art of the debut and the packaging of
  “Unmusique. “The role of motherhood here is representative of a super
 iority to everything around it. But beyond humans\, it’s a reference to 
 mother nature and creation.” They explain. As for why it’s juxtaposed 
 with gl...\n\nAll Ages\nGoldenvoice Presents: 003 Tour\nListed time is doo
 rs\n\nTickets: https://www.theregencyballroom.com/events/detail/?event_id=
 1580816\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/6/lucy-bedroque-tick
 ets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7879104;-122.4215079
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34000418/4d278108-125f-40df-b085-30020f8c2238.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261008T185326Z
LOCATION:The Regency Ballroom\, 1290 Sutter Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 
 94109
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/6/lucy-bedroque-tickets
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Steven Universe in Concert at Grace Cathedral
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261106T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261106T210000
DTSTAMP:20261020T194441Z
UID:funcheap-1642892@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Live Music Event
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerKirstin TanJoin us for a magic
 al evening of music from Steven Universe. For the first time ever\, Sixth 
 Station Trio will be collaborating with the composers of Steven Universe\,
  Aivi & Surasshu\, in a full program featuring all of your favorite tunes 
 from the show! Indulge in nostalgic songs from the beloved TV show arrange
 d for violin\, cello\, two pianos\, AND chiptune! Whether you’re a gem o
 r a human\, come join us for an unforgettable night where we transport you
  to Beach City and bring to life your favorite crystal gem adventures!\nAb
 out the Sixth Station Trio\nAnju Goto is a San Francisco-native violinist 
 and violist based in the Bay Area. He also works as an arranger for the tr
 io. He started violin at the age of 7\, and completed his undergraduate de
 gree at the San Francisco Conservatory of Music in 2020. Anju is currently
  the principal violist of the Vallejo Symphony. He has also played in orch
 estras including the Jacob Collier Audience Symphony Orchestra\, Stardew V
 alley Symphony of Seasons Orchestra\, Modesto Symphony Orchestra\, Ensembl
 e Mik Nawooj\, and The Berkeley Playhouse\, and has participated as an Eme
 rging Artist at the Mendocino Music Festival. Anju was a member of the San
  Francisco Youth Orchestra from 2015 to 2020\, serving as the principal vi
 olist during the 2019-2020 season. Besides classical music\, he is also in
 terested in a wide variety of genres\, such as Baroque performance with pe
 riod instruments\, taking Technology and Applied Comp...\n\n$25.00\n\nTick
 ets: https://gracecathedral.vbotickets.com/event/Sixth_Station_Trio_Steven
 _Universe_in_Concert_Featuring_Aivi_Surasshu/207891\nDetails: https://sf.f
 uncheap.com/steven-universe-concert-grace-cathedral/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/steven
 -universe.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261020T194441Z
LOCATION:Grace Cathedral\, 1100 California Street. San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/steven-universe-concert-grace-cathedral/
END:VEVENT
