DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerWritten by Lynne Kaufman\nPerf
 ormed by Arwen Anderson\, Lyndsy Kail\, Johnny Moreno\, and Joseph O’Mal
 ley\nDirected by Warren David Keith\nShow description: Francesca\, a conte
 mporary American filmmaker\, is shooting a documentary on a newly excavate
 d fresco in Pompeii said to provide startling evidence about sex and the s
 acred. She has obtained exclusive rights to film the fresco through the go
 od graces of Paolo\, the museum’s director and her former college sweeth
 eart. Through three time periods and the lives of three couples\, The Secr
 et Museum explores the mysteries of eros.\n\nRun dates: Nov 7–22\, 2026.
  Performances: Saturdays at 8:00 pm\; Sundays at 5:00 pm. Opening receptio
 n: Sunday\, November 8.\nTicket info (as listed): $30–$40 general seatin
 g\; $50 & $100 reserved seating. Online ticket sales close 2 hours before 
 each performance\; additional tickets may be available at the door.\nThis 
 is a Weekly Recurring Event\nRuns from Nov 7\, 2026 to Nov 22\, 2026 and h
 appens every:\nSaturdays: 8:00pm – 9:00pm Timezone: Pacific Time (US & C
 anada)\nSundays: 5:00pm – 6:00pm Timezone: Pacific Time (US & Canada)\n\
 n$30.00\n\nTickets: https://eventvesta.com/events/165716/t/tickets\nDetail
 s: https://sf.funcheap.com/2026-premiere-secret-museum-explores-pompeiis-h
 idden-fresco-sf/\nSource: Funcheap SF
