LOCATION:Bill Graham Civic Auditorium\, 99 Grove Street\, San Francisco\, 
 CA\, 94102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/11/brand-new-tickets
END:VEVENT
