BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Moth GrandSLAM Championship
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261113T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261113T210000
DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17830469@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:Another Planet Entertainment presents\nThe Moth GrandSLAM Cham
 pionship\n\nFriday\, November 13 | The Castro\n\nThe Moth is dedicated to 
 finding people from all walks of life to tell inspired stories. At The Mot
 h StorySLAM\, those people find us. On this night\, winners from our Story
 SLAM series compete to determine The San Francisco GrandSLAM Story Champio
 n.\n\nThe Moth GrandSLAM is the ultimate storytelling championship\, invit
 ing winners from The Moth’s open-mic StorySLAMs back to the stage to bat
 tle for the crown. With a full slate of local storytelling pros\, you know
  this night is going to be good. Come experience fierce\, hilarious\, and 
 sometimes even heartbreaking stories at the Moth GrandSLAM live.\n\nThe Mo
 th is a global storytelling nonprofit with the mission to inspire people t
 o listen and share openly\, think and feel deeply\, and expand their under
 standing of one another. Since 1997\, The Moth has presented more than 70\
 ,000 true stories—told live and without notes—in 11 countries\, across
  4 continents. Today\, The Moth produces 600+ live shows annually\, as wel
 l as the Peabody Award-winning The Moth Radio Hour\, and the popular The M
 oth Podcast. Through workshops for students\, educators\, adults\, advocat
 es\, and professionals\, The Moth guides thousands of new storytellers eac
 h year in finding and sharing their own voices. Learn more at themoth.org 
 @MothStories\n\n16+\nAnother Planet Entertainment presents\nListed time is
  doors\n\nTickets: https://thecastro.com/events/the-moth-261113\nDetails: 
 https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/13/the-moth-grandslam-championship-tic
 kets\nSource: DoTheBay
