CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:Goldenvoice Presents\nHeadache\n\nSaturday\, November 14 | ​
 The Regency Ballroom\n\nThank You For Almost Everything is the sophomore a
 lbum for Headache\, a collaboration between writer and poet Francis Hornsb
 y Clark and music-producer Joseph Thornalley aka Vegyn. This new album fol
 lows on the surprise underground success of their debut: The Head Hurts Bu
 t The Heart Knows The Truth (released 31 May 2023) releasing on Vegyn’s 
 own PLZ Make It Ruins label.\n\nThe debut record has streamed over 19.4 mi
 llion times on Spotify alone and sold over 8\,000 physical copies worldwid
 e. The debut gained its popularity entirely organically with zero marketin
 g or PR spend. Since its release\, Headache has built a dedicated global f
 anbase\, with several fans even going so far as to get lyrics or the proje
 ct’s logo tattooed on themselves.\n\nThank You For Almost Everything con
 tinues the original’s distinct style of Trip-Hop / Downtempo Electronica
  but combining with its own unique (and now imitated) AI-voiced spoken wor
 d. For this new album\, Headache steps away from the hum-drum of Blighty a
 nd instead focuses his gaze to sunnier shores. Recalling personal historie
 s of ruffled hair and school cafeterias\, ancient unsolved Albionic riddle
 s\, Rome’s changing seasons and its poignant graffiti\, arguments with g
 irlfriends at luxury hotel beachfront restaurants\, and what it truly feel
 s like to be alive in this inscrutable but beautiful world.\n\nThe project
  features a further collaboration with artist Cali Thornhill De...\n\nAll 
 Ages\nGoldenvoice Presents\nListed time is doors\n\nTickets: https://www.t
 heregencyballroom.com/events/detail/?event_id=1447645\nDetails: https://do
 thebay.com/events/2026/11/14/headache-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7879104;-122.4215079
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/32175818/2a761f62-4b92-4d6d-b9ae-b61392d38af4.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261008T185326Z
LOCATION:The Regency Ballroom\, 1290 Sutter Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 
 94109
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/14/headache-tickets
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Rhye
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T210000
