BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Vince Staples
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261115T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261115T220000
DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17492892@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:Goldenvoice Presents\nCry Baby Tour\nVince Staples\nSunday\, N
 ovember 15 | The Warfield\n\nIt opens with the ephemeral sounds of nature.
  Birds\, bugs\, and airy notes chiming in the air. Then\, the undercurrent
  of something darker\, disrupting the fantasy: a distorted voice. “To li
 ve is to be\,” the voice says\, “Like the nigga in the tree.” This i
 s how Dark Times\, Vince Staples’ eighth studio album\, begins.\n\nIt’
 s a new era in the prolific artist’s canon\, a muscular and revelatory w
 ork refining elements that have been present in his catalog for the last d
 ecade: dense lyricism over lush\, layered beats\; wry\, melancholic observ
 ations about life\; finding pockets of light in an endless dark. For Stapl
 es\, the album is “a snapshot” of this period of his life.\n\n“It’
 s been 10 years since I started putting things out properly\,” he says\,
  referencing his first EP\, with Def Jam in 2014\, Shyne Coldchain Vol 2\,
  “I don’t really keep track of any of that stuff\, but it’s importan
 t to take a second to appreciate the journey.” The title came intuitivel
 y to Staples after he listened to the record in full\, noticing heavy moti
 fs that kept reappearing. The album cover\, featuring a faintly seen noose
 \, was similarly intuitive.\n\nStaples began recording the album over a se
 ven-month stretch\, during weekly sessions in North Hollywood. At the time
 \, he was in post-production on his critically acclaimed Netflix series Th
 e Vince Staples Show\, which he wrote\, produced and starred in. Working o
 n the show was “very\, very in...\n\n6+\nGoldenvoice Presents: Cry Baby 
 Tour\n\nTickets: https://www.axs.com/events/1486743/vince-staples-tickets?
 skin=warfield&src=AEGLIVE_WWRFLSFO022715VEN001?cid=usaffdostuff\nDetails: 
 https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/15/vince-staples-tickets\nSource: DoTh
 eBay
GEO:37.7827039;-122.4103578
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/32768192/3b2808dd-f840-4509-b486-ca1bb3d8ef11.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T003107Z
LOCATION:The Warfield\, 982 Market St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/15/vince-staples-tickets
END:VEVENT
