  ten years after ‘Blue Lights’\, the Platinum-selling debut single tha
 t introduced Jorja’s singular voice and set the course for one of Britis
 h music’s most influential musicians. Since 2016\, Jorja has delivered t
 wo No.3 albums – Gold selling debut “Lost & Found” (2018) and “Fal
 ling Or Flying” (2023) – and collaborated with global superstars inclu
 ding Kendrick Lamar\, Burna Boy\, Stormzy\, Drake and Giggs. The Walsall b
 orn singer and songwriter has won two BRITs and received nominations for a
  Grammy\, an Ivor Novello and the Mercury Prize and currently counts over 
 11 million monthly listeners and 4.7 billion streams on Spotify alone\, wi
 th eight million followers across socials.\n\nJorja had already had a run 
