DESCRIPTION:Another Planet Entertainment Presents\nRitual Tour\nIcona Pop\
 nWednesday\, November 18 | ​The Independent\n\nIcona Pop always represen
 ted the ultimate freedom of expression for its two members and longtime fr
 iends: Caroline Hjelt and Aino Jawo. Their freedom as women and artists ha
 s underscored their thriving impact and influence as one of pop music’s 
 most innovative and irresistible multiplatinum chart-topping forces. Howev
 er\, their third full-length album\, Ritual\, is actually about ownership.
  They are owning who they are as mothers\, creative partners\, entrepreneu
 rs\, leaders\, sisters\, and women. These women are running the dancefloor
  now. Caroline and Aino went from being club kids in Stockholm to commandi
 ng clubs\, arenas\, and festivals from the stage. Following an independent
  grind\, Icona Pop first reached critical mass during 2012. The duo’s br
 eakout single\, “I Love It” [feat. Charli XCX]\, has endured as a gene
 rational banger. It went RIAA 5x-Platinum\, sold north of 10 million digit
 al singles\, and even entered rarified air as part of Spotify’s “Billi
 ons Club” with over 1.2 billion streams on the platform. Following their
  Gold-certified full-length debut\, This Is… Icona Pop in 2013\, they no
 tched two more Gold singles\, headlined sold out tours\, and supported the
  likes of Miley Cyrus\, One Direction\, The Chainsmokers\, and the late Av
 icii. Beyond performances on The Tonight Show Starring Jimmy Fallon\, The 
 Today Show\, Good Morning America\, and America’s Got Talent\, they popp
 ed up on t...\n\n$37.05\, All Ages\nAnother Planet Entertainment Presents:
  Ritual Tour\nListed time is doors\n\nTickets: https://www.theindependents
 f.com/tm-event/icona-pop/\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/18
 /icona-pop-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
