DESCRIPTION:Another Planet Entertainment presents\nTHE BEDROOM SESSIONS US
  TOUR\nDanna\nFriday\, November 20 | The Castro\n\nDANNA is a Latin GRAMMY
 -nominated Mexican singer\, songwriter\, actress\, and entrepreneur whose 
 career spans more than two decades across music\, television\, theater\, a
 nd film. One of the most influential Latin artists of her generation\, she
  has successfully evolved from a celebrated child star into a global pop f
 orce\, earning acclaim for her powerful vocals\, artistic versatility\, an
 d cultural impact. She is stepping into a new era as a multidimensional cr
 eative force and visionary with her upcoming project\, VISIONS\, an immers
 ive universe that blends music and storytelling in an entirely new way.Fou
 r of her albums have reached Billboard’s “Top Latin Pop Albums” char
 t\, while another landed on the “Top Latin Albums” chart. In 2025 her 
 track “Khe Calor” was featured in Rolling Stone’s “The 50 Best Lat
 in And Spanish-Language Songs Of 2025.” Her acclaimed career includes co
 llaborations with artists such as Steve Aoki\, Ne-Yo\, Alesso\, Juan Gabri
 el\, David Bisbal\, Aitana\, Santa Fe Klan\, Morat\, and Sebastián Yatra\
 , as well as standout performances on screen and stage. She starred in Net
 flix’s Elite and in the official Mexican production of the Broadway musi
 cal Wicked\, where she portrayed Elphaba\, and later voiced Elphaba in the
  official Spanish-language dub of the feature film adaptation.\n\nqBeyond 
 entertainment\, DANNA has become a leading voice at the intersection of mu
 sic\, fashion\,...\n\nall ages\nAnother Planet Entertainment presents: THE
  BEDROOM SESSIONS US TOUR\nListed time is doors\n\nTickets: https://thecas
 tro.com/events/danna-261120\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/
 20/danna-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
