DESCRIPTION:The Academy SF presents\nLegends Awards\n\nSunday\, November 2
 2 | The Castro\n\nThe Academy’s annual Legends Awards returns November 2
 2 for a night of celebration and giving thanks at the iconic Castro Theatr
 e. The Legends Awards honors extraordinary people whose contributions have
  shaped San Francisco’s LGBTQ+ community and whose stories deserve a per
 manent place in its history.\n\nThis year\, we celebrate our allies by pre
 senting Speaker Emerita Nancy Pelosi with the evening’s highest honor. S
 he is joined by community award recipients Mark Leno\, Gael Lala-Chávez\,
  and Angel Adeyoha.\n\nAn incredible lineup of special guests\, led by Sis
 ter Roma and fashion designer Zac Posen\, will also include Music Director
  Russell Deason\, Donna Sachet\, Honey Davenport\, and performances by Edu
 ardo González-Maldonado and Leanne Borghesi.\n\nJoin us Sunday\, November
  22\, for a night of giving thanks to the leaders\, builders\, artists\, a
 dvocates\, and allies who have made our community what it is today—and c
 ontinue to shape what comes next.\n\nall ages\nThe Academy SF presents\nLi
 sted time is doors\n\nTickets: https://thecastro.com/events/legends-awards
 -261122\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/22/legends-awards-ti
 ckets\nSource: DoTheBay
