CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:On June 29\, 2026\, Beijing singer-songwriter Song Dongye rele
 ased Take Another Moment\, his second album and his first full-length rele
 ase in thirteen years. On this world tour\, the new songs will be presente
 d alongside the old favorites that have stayed with listeners all these ye
 ars. Between 2017 and 2018\, Song Dongye released three pivotal singles—
 “Empty Harbor Song\,” “Guo Yuan Chao\,” and “To Know”—each q
 uietly expanding the boundaries of folk music and reshaping the industry
 ’s perception of him. Now\, thirteen years after his landmark debut Anhe
  Bridge North\, arrives his long-awaited second album\, Take Another Momen
 t. Entirely self-conceived\, arranged\, and produced\, it stands as a work
  that\, even now\, surpasses all expectations upon listening. Over the yea
 rs\, he has lost weight. He fishes. He takes photographs. He plays with be
 ads. And he has completed Take Another Moment\, an album astonishing in bo
 th its lyrical scope and sonic depth. He remains the songwriter\, arranger
 \, and producer at the center of his work. Alongside him are more than twe
 nty instruments and sound sources\, leading lights of China’s jazz world
  such as Wen Zhiyong\, Xia Jia\, and Nathaniel Gao\, and independent spiri
 ts as subtle and reclusive as Xing Jiangbo He is still occasionally playfu
 l\, perhaps as a way of balancing his absolute seriousness and devotion to
  music—once even letting his cat's backside appear on an album cover. Hi
 s photographs\, too\, remain quietly meaningful gazes upon the world aroun
 d him. H...\n\nAll Ages\nLUCID Live Music & AIVN\n\nTickets: https://www.a
 xs.com/events/1613808/song-dongye-tickets?skin=warfield&src=AEGLIVE_WWRFLS
 FO022715VEN001?cid=usaffdostuff\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026
 /11/23/song-dongye-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7827039;-122.4103578
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34677676/54d49606-a9a1-4607-82e0-59ce5d1606ee.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T003107Z
LOCATION:The Warfield\, 982 Market St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/23/song-dongye-tickets
END:VEVENT
