SUMMARY:Amtrac
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261127T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261127T220000
DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17752477@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:Long established for his chameleonic proficiency\, Amtrac spen
 t the last decade proving himself with melodic house tracks\, infectious i
 ndie dance hooks and everything in between. Amtrac is a multi-instrumental
 ist\, vocalist\, producer\, and DJ. He’s played sold-out arena shows\, u
 nderground clubs and festivals around the world. His recent co-headline to
 ur with Tourist sold out venues across North America.\n\nHe’s released t
 hree full-length albums and a slew of varied singles and EPs\, not to ment
 ion marquee collaborations with Diplo and Leon Bridges\, Elderbrook\, Shak
 ka and Kaskade. He’s remixed everyone from Bob Moses to Alesso\, Two Doo
 r Cinema Club\, Ellie Goulding\, Washed Out\, UNKLE\, Axwell/Ingrosso\, ZH
 U\, Bob Moses & more. He runs his own label\, Openers\, named in a nod to 
 the way he’s managed to straddle both the bright lights of the mainstage
  world and the taste-making underground without ever losing sense of who h
 e really is—and still\, he’s never felt quite as focused as this.\n\nI
 f tickets in the accessible section are unavailable\, please reach out to 
 the venue for accommodations. Please note\, orders in violation of the pub
 lished ticket limit are subject to cancellation without notice. Ticket pri
 ces may fluctuate\, at any time\, based on demand.\n\nGoldenvoice Presents
 \n\nTickets: https://shop.axs.com/?c=axs&e=30567424546685009\nDetails: htt
 ps://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/27/amtrac-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
