DESCRIPTION:Songwriters Showcase\nat the fabulous Ocean Ale House\n1314 Oc
 ean Avenue San Francisco\, CA\n11/29/2026 from 1:00 until 4:00 PM\n\nVittl
 es\, libations & good vibrations\n\nAnd what a line-up!\n\nErik Walker * B
 ill Leigh * PHUONIEX * Sonny Boy Daniel * David Kesler\n\nErik Walker is p
 erhaps best known for the piece “CLIMATE”\, released in 2019\, which w
 as done in collaboration with climate scientists from the UC Berkeley lab.
 \nBill Leigh is a San Francisco singer-songwriter and bassist known for ca
 tchy songs\,\nemotionally resonant lyrics\, and careful craftsmanship.\nPH
 UONIEX is a Vietnamese American singer-songwriter\, blending intimate indi
 e folk-pop with acoustic roots and warm\, conversational vocals.\nSonny Bo
 y renders original songs\, old blues classics and unexpected covers in a r
 ough-hewn but effective delivery\, combining lively vocals with a deft tou
 ch on the dobro.\nYou never know with David Kesler\, whether he's about to
  rock you out or lay bare a slice of family lore guaranteed to bring you t
 o tears. As we write\, he's headed to Nepal for some serious mountain clim
 bing.\n\nCheck out Upcoming Shows for biographical details & more Songwrit
 ers Showcase performances!\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.songwriters-sho
 wcase.com/upcoming\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/29/songwr
 iters-showcase-ocean-ale-house-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
