DESCRIPTION:Connor BuckleyThe highest-level genetics conversation in the w
 orld returns to the Bay Area this December to help growers worldwide garde
 n harder\, better\, faster\, and stronger.\nOver 1\,000 growers big and sm
 all from around the world interact with 30 of the world’s top breeders o
 ver two days December 5 and 6 in a private Bay Area venue for Terpnami. Gu
 ests can RSVP today to get ticketing and event details.\nThe world’s fir
 st only ‘seed rave\,’ Terpnami runs 12 to 5 p.m. Saturday and Sunday\,
  December 5 and 6\, with live DJs\, visuals\, local food\, drink\, and cre
 ative art and merch collabs\; plus pre and after-parties\, dinners and mee
 tups.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://sfspacewalk.com/terpnami-2026-announceme
 nt/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/worlds-terpnami-seed-rave-returns-sf
 -live-djs-breeders-art-dec-56/\nSource: Funcheap SF\n\nAlso listed on:\n- 
