BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:it’s murph
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T210000
DTSTAMP:20261007T210655Z
UID:dothebay-17717683@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:SIGN UP FOR ARTIST PRESALE\n\nAnother Planet Entertainment Pre
 sents\nit’s murph\nwith Tobiahs\n\nSaturday\, December 5 | Bill Graham C
 ivic Auditorium\n\nit’s murph is a Nashville-based electronic producer c
 rafting dance music that’s meant to be felt as much as it’s heard. Roo
 ted in emotion but built for movement\, his sound lives at the intersectio
 n of euphoric melody\, gritty low-end\, and expansive atmosphere — pulli
 ng listeners into moments that feel both intimate and anthemic.\n\nDriven 
 by the belief that music is a multi-sensory experience\, it’s murph crea
 tes records designed to unlock something deeper: a memory\, a feeling\, a 
 shared release on the dancefloor. His productions balance warmth and edge\
 , pairing melodic progressions with driving grooves that keep crowds locke
 d in while leaving space to breathe.\n\nBlending influences from tech hous
 e\, bass-forward dance\, and melodic electronic music\, his sound draws in
 spiration from artists like Fred again..\, Cloonee\, and Chris Lake\, whil
 e remaining distinctly his own. Whether in headphones or under strobe ligh
 ts\, it’s murph’s music invites listeners to step outside themselves a
 nd fully immerse in the moment.\n\nAs his catalog continues to grow\, it
 ’s murph is carving out a lane defined by emotional energy\, forward-thi
 nking production\, and a deep connection to the people on the other side o
 f the speakers.\n\n18+\nAnother Planet Entertainment Presents\nListed time
  is doors\n\nTickets: https://ticketmaster.evyy.net/c/253185/264167/4272?S
 haredId=DoStuff&u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ticketmaster.com%2Fits-murph-18-san-fr
 ancisco-california-12-05-2026%2Fevent%2F1C0065043113836F%3Fcamefrom%3DCFC_
 ANOTHERPLANET_DTB%26brand%3Danotherplanet\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/e
 vents/2026/12/5/it-s-murph-bill-graham-civic-auditorium-tickets\nSource: D
 oTheBay
GEO:37.77814499999999;-122.4174374
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/33828705/dd10c25d-a981-4556-b301-4cc2c1f939d1.gif
LAST-MODIFIED:20261007T210655Z
LOCATION:Bill Graham Civic Auditorium\, 99 Grove Street\, San Francisco\, 
 CA\, 94102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/5/it-s-murph-bill-graham-civic-aud
 itorium-tickets
