BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ripe
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261206T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261206T220000
DTSTAMP:20261007T210655Z
UID:dothebay-17778752@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:Goldenvoice Presents\nRipe\n\nSunday\, December 6 | ​The Reg
 ency Ballroom\n\nRipe’s new album Bright Blues is a collection of 12 son
 gs full of sleek grooves and bold melodies that the Boston quartet put tog
 ether to help ride out tough times\, an anthem for better days ahead.\n\n
 “The wildest thing for me is that the record simultaneously sounds like 
 it has the scars of everything we’ve been through and also that it doesn
 ’t — it’s joyful music\, which is very exciting given that it was ma
 de in the middle of getting hit in the stomach\,” says singer Robbie Wul
 fsohn\, who came together with guitarist Jon Becker\, drummer Sampson Hell
 erman and trombonist Calvin Barthel while they were all studying at Berkle
 e College of Music.\n\nThe band drew acclaim from the likes of the Boston 
 Globe\, Huffington Post and WXPN with their first full-length\, Joy in the
  Wild Unknown. Their streams on Spotify surged past 56 million as they con
 quered stages at festivals including Bonnaroo\, Firefly\, SweetWater and B
 ottlerock\, and sold tens of thousands of tickets across the US\, includin
 g selling out the iconic House of Blues Boston and Brooklyn Steel.\n\nBrig
 ht Blues is their first release after signing to indie powerhouse Glassnot
 e Records and their first release working with outside co-writers. Teaming
  up on production with Noah Conrad (BTS\, Niall Horan) and Ryan Linvill (O
 livia Rodrigo\, Dermot Kennedy) helped bring the high-energy\, freewheelin
 g stage show to the recording studio\, with the result being an album that
  s...\n\nGoldenvoice Presents\n\nTickets: https://shop.axs.com/?c=axs&e=30
 567424546786243\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/6/ripe-ticke
 ts\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7879104;-122.4215079
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34122266/d223561f-4578-420c-b328-dace71ed485d.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261007T210655Z
LOCATION:The Regency Ballroom\, 1290 Sutter Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 
 94109
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/6/ripe-tickets
END:VEVENT
