DESCRIPTION:Another Planet Entertainment presents\nAngine de Poitrine\n\nM
 onday\, December 7 | The Castro\n\nDisciples of planet Earth’s rock deit
 ies\, space-time voyagers Klek and Khn de Poitrine gaze in wonder at hot d
 ogs\, pyramids\, and rock music in all its glorious excess.\n\nAsymmetrica
 l and dissonant\, Angine de Poitrine’s music makes hearts race and bodie
 s move with ecstatic abandon. Through tight\, pulsing drum grooves and int
 ricate tangles of double-neck microtonal guitar\, the band summons swirlin
 g vortices of hypnotic sound and vision.\n\nSince the release of Vol. 1 in
  2024\, Angine de Poitrine are in the eye of an ever-growing storm of enth
 usiasm from audiences\, critics\, and music industry’s main actors. Afte
 r delivering electrifying performances at Quebec’s major festivals\, inc
 luding the Festival International de Jazz de Montréal\, Angine de Poitrin
 e now sets their sights on the prestigious Trans Musicales in Rennes.\n\nA
 ll these facts are strictly reserved to the humanoids: Angine de Poitrine 
 are simply thrilled to play rock ’n’ roll.\n\nall ages\nSold out\nAnot
 her Planet Entertainment presents\nListed time is doors\n\nTickets: https:
 //ticketmaster.evyy.net/c/253185/264167/4272?SharedId=DoStuff&u=https%3A%2
 F%2Fwww.ticketmaster.com%2Fangine-de-poitrine-san-francisco-california-12-
 07-2026%2Fevent%2F1C0064A8A7A82B29%3Fcamefrom%3DCFC_ANOTHERPLANET_web%26br
 and%3Danotherplanet\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/7/angine
 -de-poitrine-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7619917;-122.4347365
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/32211949/019bf92f-9c2c-490d-a1fc-d630c0cd39ba.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261008T185326Z
LOCATION:The Castro\, 429 Castro St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94114
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/7/angine-de-poitrine-tickets
END:VEVENT
