 op-up at SPARK Social San José featuring Indian food vendors\, bars\, cha
 i\, coffee\, sweet treats\, local makers\, holiday shopping\, family activ
 ities\, and a dedicated kids area. The program includes a Non Stop Bhangra
  dance party with DJs\, live dhol\, dance lessons\, and performances.\nOri
 ginal Event Description:\n_Is Coming to the South Bay!! 🌻 After 22 year
 s of cultural celebrations\, we’re excited to bring Non Stop Bhangra to 
 San José with Colors of India-A Holiday Pop-Up Experience! ✨ Join us at
  SPARK Social San José\, a vibrant new outdoor gathering space in the hea
 rt of Creekside in downtown San José\, for a colorful afternoon of music\
 , dance\, food\, holiday shopping\, and family-friendly fun! If you’ve b
 een a part of our @bhangraandbeats Night Market celebrations in San Franci
 sco\, you know the energy! And if you’re new to Non Stop Bhangra\, we ca
 n’t wait to celebrate with you! Everyone is welcome. 💛 ✨ What to Ex
 pect: 🍛 Indian Food Vendors + Bay Area Flavors 🍹 Full Bars + Chai\, 
 Coffee & Sweet Treats 🛍️ Local Makers + Holiday Shopping 🎨 Family-
 Friendly Activities + Dedicated Kids Area 🎶 Non Stop Bhangra Dance Part
 y(DJ’s\, Live Dhol\, Dance Lesson & performances) ✨ Event Details: 
 🌻 Colors of India — A Holiday Pop-Up Experience 📅 Saturday\, Decem
 ber 12 | 12–5 PM 📍 SPARK Social San José | 140 S. Montgomery St. ✨
  FREE • ALL AGES 🎟️ RSVP link in profile ✨ Indian-inspired fits e
 ncouraged! Bring your colors\, sparkle\, and festive spiri...\n\nFree\n\nT
 ickets: https://www.instagram.com/p/Dezr9tRPHcL/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_li
 nk&amp\;psln=NTc4MTIwNjQ2YQ==\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/colors-ind
 ia-free-holiday-popup-indian-food-fest-dance-party-san-jos/\nSource: Funch
