UID:dothebay-17352623@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:Another Planet Entertainment Presents\nPokey LaFarge\nwith Cic
 ada Rhythm\nWednesday\, December 16 | Bimbo's 365 Club\n\nFor two decades\
 , Pokey LaFarge has walked his own effortlessly cool road as an exceptiona
 lly iconoclastic troubadour – forthright\, genuine\, and markedly keen t
 o put it all out there. Rent Money now sees him pushing forward yet again 
 in what can be safely declared his finest collection to date\, both as an 
 heartfelt expression of personal experience and as no-nonsense social comm
 entary. With its twanging guitars\, plucky rhythms\, and undeniably captiv
 ating melodies\, the album soars and swings\, its joyous refrains belying 
 the inescapable undercurrent of constant worry and angst that permeates th
 ese troubled times. As always\, the Illinois native deftly traverses the g
 enre boundaries\, seamlessly integrating the myriad strains of 20th-centur
 y American music with a freewheeling command of earnest songcraft\, inspir
 ed performance\, and subversive creativity. Rent Money stands tall as an i
 ndisputable high-water mark for Pokey LaFarge – a defining collection fr
 om a one-of-a-kind artist of rare ingenuity and uncommon candor\, now as e
 ver\, determinedly crafting a sure-footed brand of deeply human music all 
 his own.\n\n“People are always going to tell you what they think you sho
 uld play\,” says Pokey LaFarge\, “what you should sing about\, how you
  should sound\, how you should look\, how you should act. And I’ve alway
 s just been like\, nah. Nope. I’ve just completely gone my own way\, and
 ...\n\n21+\nAnother Planet Entertainment Presents\n\nTickets: https://tick
 etmaster.evyy.net/c/253185/264167/4272?SharedId=DoStuff&u=https%3A%2F%2Fww
 w.ticketweb.com%2Fevent%2Fpokey-lafarge-bimbos-365-club-tickets%2F14903433
 \nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/16/pokey-lafarge-tickets\nS
 ource: DoTheBay
