DESCRIPTION:Multi-hyphenate superstar and 3x Grammy-award winner Victoria 
 Monét has been stealthily— and steadily— trailblazing her own gilded 
 path in music for over a decade. She released her long-awaited debut album
  in 2023\, JAGUAR II\, and the extended version\, JAGUAR II: Deluxe\, in 2
 024. With JAGUAR II\, Monét delivered a handful of singles from the album
  including her culture defining hit single “On My Mama” – its iconic
  music video garnering over 107 million views. “On My Mama” earned thr
 ee #1 spots on the R&B / Hip-Hop radio and charted in the Top 40. She publ
 icly received praise from music industry titans like Beyoncé\, Janet Jack
 son\, Cardi B\, Bruno Mars\, SZA\, Adele\, Kelly Rowland\, Ariana Grande\,
  Ciara\, Zendaya and more.\n\nA critical darling\, Victoria’s debut albu
 m was named the #1 Best of 2023 by The Hollywood Reporter and included on 
 Best of 2023 lists by everyone from Barack Obama\, Jay-Z\, NPR\, TIME\, Ro
 lling Stone\, CLASH\, VOGUE\, ELLE\, Harper’s BAZAAR\, Billboard\, AP an
 d many more. She was also featured on the 2024 cover of Variety’s Grammy
  Issue and received both the “Rising Star” Award and “Triple Threat
 ” Award at their annual Hitmakers event. Monét’s resounding breakthro
 ugh success with JAGUAR II resulted in two 2024 NAACP Image Awards for Out
 standing Album and Outstanding New Artist\, five 2024 BET Award nomination
 s (including two wins for BET HER and Video of The Year)\, the 2024 Hitmak
 er Award at Billboard Power Players\, TIME Magazine’s 2024 TIME100 Next 
 Gen list\, in addition to...\n\nall ages\nListed time is doors\n\nTickets:
  https://ticketmaster.evyy.net/c/253185/264167/4272?SharedId=DoStuff&u=htt
 ps%3A%2F%2Fwww.ticketmaster.com%2Fvictoria-monet-frequency-of-love-tour-sa
 n-francisco-california-12-17-2026%2Fevent%2F1C006523E4C75D1A%3Fcamefrom%3D
 CFC_ANOTHERPLANET_web%26brand%3Danotherplanet\nDetails: https://dothebay.c
 om/events/2026/12/17/victoria-monet-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
