 \, merriment\, and holiday cheer!\nBegin by listening to the wonderful Com
 fort & Joy Carolers\, then join in as we promenade through historic Hamilt
 on\, singing beloved holiday favorites at special Hamilton stopping points
  along the way.\n\nOur celebration will conclude at the Hamilton Community
  Center\, transformed into our own festive Winter Wonderland—where the h
 oliday fun continues!\nEnjoy holiday activities\, face painting\, complime
 ntary hot cider\, endless sweet treats\, a Secret Santa raffle\, and so mu
 ch more.\nBring your family\, bring your friends\, and bring your holiday 
